# 11.71 check (2026-10-19): go (U+ACE0) floor ink renews while the canes stand and dries with them; one pool per cane on the first frame.
# Pass 1 at slow 0.25 (fx probes through the life), pass 2 at full speed for the feel; Dummy_10m, no overlay.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
?call SpellLab308 Run lock:Dummy_10m
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.25
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:d119_go_slow:18
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brushlog:6
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uACE0
sleep 2
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_d119_go_early
sleep 2
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_d119_go_mid
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_d119_go_late
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 4
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_d119_go_end
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 4
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
?call SpellLab308 Run lock:Dummy_10m
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:d119_go_real:8
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brushlog:6
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uACE0
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
